flowchart LR
  USER[Single user] -->|HTTPS| WEB[Web API]
  WEB --> DB[(Private PostgreSQL)]
  WORKER[Private worker] --> DB
  WEB --> HM[Private Hypermail]
  WORKER --> HM
  HM --> PROVIDERS[Mail providers]
  BODY[Body cache] -->|90 days| PURGE[Purge]
  META[Metadata / activity / audit] -->|indefinite| KEEP[Retain]
  ATTACH[Temporary attachment bytes] -->|request completion| CLEAN[Clean]
